@startuml RentSplit_Expense_State
[*] --> Draft
Draft --> PendingConfirmation : receipt extracted / manual entry
PendingConfirmation --> Active : user confirms
PendingConfirmation --> Draft : user edits
Active --> PartiallySettled : payment recorded
PartiallySettled --> Settled : remaining balance = 0
Active --> Cancelled : expense cancelled
Draft --> Cancelled : discarded
Settled --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]
@enduml
